(document (TeXmacs "2.1.4") (style (tuple "generic" "chinese" "table-captions-above" "number-europe" "preview-ref")) (body (document (concat (with "font-series" "bold" "任务编号") "：6202") (concat (with "font-series" "bold" "任务内容") "：") "1.修复AI侧边栏的引用块中，无序列表会被截断，没有正确换行的问题。" (with "par-mode" "center" (image (tuple (raw-data "") "png") "0.8par" "0.892121par" "" "")) "    参考修复方向：无" (concat (with "font-series" "bold" "注意事项") "：") "1、构建采用非社区版（is_community=n)" (concat "2、提交的pr的标题、正文，参考09开头编号的pr，比如：" (hlink "[1601] 修复释义引文1（上下文）的半截 herk 与段落内容丢失，上下文预算拉齐 by PinkMagicFly <centerdot> Pull Request #4627 <centerdot> MoganLab/mogan" "https://github.com/MoganLab/mogan/pull/4627")) "3、devel里惯例要写的任务文档，追加在本文件中。" "4、可以采用 Python 的 pynput 框架来自动化测试。" "" "验收标准：" "      检验文字：无" "      gui自动测试（选用一段上下文中有无序列表的文字，使用AI操作栏的释义功能，查看打开的ai侧边栏中的引用1部分是否符合标准)")) (initial (collection (associate "page-medium" "paper") (associate "page-screen-margin" "false") (associate "stem-doc-id" "B6821CBC-B1A5-4440-8E37-E39959425370"))))